The prompt template names the surface `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/AnalyticsSummaryWidget.*`.
That literal path does not exist in this repo's Xcode project: project.yml (XcodeGen, ADR-002)
compiles ONE shared SwiftUI group `apps/apple/Sources/` into the iOS + macOS app targets, and
SwiftLint's `included:` list is {Sources, Tests, ...}. Per the P4 README binding rule
("Allowed files scoped to apps/apple/**"), the generator's `TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/` token
maps to the project's real compiled group. The surface was therefore placed where it is genuinely
compiled, linted, formatted and tested (no project.yml / .swiftlint.yml edits needed):

